    "text": "Put your dot on call.\n\nAli, an engineer at OpenAI, used his dot to triage an on-call incident at 3am.\n\nHis dot investigated the issue and started a Codex thread, so he could steer the work from his phone in the ChatGPT app. https://t.co/xLhtGUSzsx",
