  {
    "id": "2111192259073094035",
    "text": "GPT-6 Astra Pro in ChatGPT got an upgrade with faster responses and improved use of plugins and tools.\n\nAnd now, multiple agents can tackle different parts of a task in parallel. You can follow each agent’s progress and open completed tasks to review their work.\n\nNow available to Pro users in the Chat tab.",
    "author": {
      "id": "4398626122",
      "name": "OpenAI",
      "screenName": "OpenAI",
      "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1885410181409820672/ztsaR0JW_normal.jpg",
      "verified": true
    },
    "metrics": {
