  {
    "id": "2110741355739963884",
    "text": "We want to support the mathematics community in turning progress in AI into deeper human understanding and new discoveries. To support that goal, we are contributing $5 million to a new Simons Foundation initiative to help mathematicians examine, understand, and build on results produced by AI, including the results we recently published.\n\nThe funding, managed and awarded by the @SimonsFdn will support workshops, conferences, and special programs. We will also provide access to our models and computing resources to Simons Foundation-supported researchers.",
    "author": {
      "id": "4398626122",
      "name": "OpenAI",
      "screenName": "OpenAI",
      "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1885410181409820672/ztsaR0JW_normal.jpg",
      "verified": true
    },
    "metrics": {
      "likes": 6148,
      "retweets": 485,
      "replies": 509,
      "quotes": 228,
      "views": 908933,
      "bookmarks": 874
    },
    "createdAt": "Thu Oct 15 14:35:29 +0000 2026",
    "createdAtLocal": "2026-10-15 22:35",
    "createdAtISO": "2026-10-15T14:35:29+00:00",
    "media": [],
    "urls": [],
    "isRetweet": false,
    "retweetedBy": null,
    "lang": "en",
    "score": null,
    "quotedTweet": {
      "id": "2110740786169979088",
      "text": "How can the math community forge the best path forward in the AI age? We're committing $15M to workshops and initiatives — plus free AI computing resources for foundation-supported researchers — through new partnerships with @AnthropicAI and @OpenAI: https://t.co/G8slrHoiad\n\n#math #science #AI",
      "author": {
        "screenName": "SimonsFdn",
        "name": "Simons Foundation"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2110442001749659890",
    "text": "European businesses are rapidly expanding their use of AI agents. More than half of the AI use among our EU enterprise and business customers now involves these tools, and the number of small business users has grown 8x across the region.\n\nOur latest Economic Research report explores Europe’s shift toward agentic AI—and the opportunity to turn broader adoption into deeper use.\n\nhttps://t.co/jUjCF5sW0B",
    "author": {
      "id": "4398626122",
      "name": "OpenAI",
      "screenName": "OpenAI",
